{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_223_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_223","textTraditional":"一、十有一年。春，宋公之弟辰及仲佗、石彄、公子池，自陳入于蕭，以叛。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_223_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_223","textTraditional":"二、夏四月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_223_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_223","textTraditional":"三、秋，宋樂世心自曹入于蕭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_223_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_223","textTraditional":"四、冬，及鄭平。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_223_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_223","textTraditional":"五、叔還如鄭莅盟。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}